! Shower arm: VINCIA -- the antenna shower.
!
! NOTE the base card's SpaceShower:*/TimeShower:* settings do NOT apply here:
! Vincia reads Vincia:* instead, so dipoleRecoil and pTmaxMatch as set for the
! simple shower are silently inert and Vincia's own defaults take over.  That
! is part of what "as shipped" means in the README and is why this arm is not
! a controlled variation of one parameter.
PartonShowers:model = 2
